-- DM 0.14.1 legacy dataset (schema at migration 0038) for the Silicon Accounts upgrade tests.
-- Generated on 2026-10-10 by driving the 0.14.1 store API (commit e175aa4) against a database
-- migrated to 0038, then `pg_dump --data-only --schema=dm --disable-triggers --inserts`
-- (contract_versions and iam_authorization_revision are seeded by the migrations themselves).
-- Organizations: tos, bricks. Identities: c:saket, c:ada, c:old-timer (left unmapped by the
-- tests), si:cos. Contents: direct conversations (the c:saket/c:ada pair in both organizations),
-- ISI routing, a GIF, an attachment, an edit, a tombstone, a receipt, a Silicon bundle, a draft,
-- three groups (explicit invitations, public, IAM tag), Ting handoffs and a presence lease.
-- Load it with triggers disabled (superuser), exactly as dumped.
